# Everything here is excluded from the build CONTEXT — the tarball sent to the
# builder before the first instruction runs. The Dockerfile only COPYs
# package.json, package-lock.json, server/ and public/, so nothing below is
# needed; keeping it out mostly saves upload time (Android/ alone is tens of MB
# of Gradle caches) and keeps local secrets out of the daemon entirely.
node_modules
data
.env
.git
.github
.claude
*.tar.gz

# Not part of the runtime image
test
scripts
Android
docs
restore
temp
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
*.md
LICENSE
